{"type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_1785871311387", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "好的。我现在已经建立了稳固的基准。从搜索中获得的关键发现如下：\n\n1. **MONA (Benster et al., 2024)** - EMG 静默语音领域的新 SOTA，采用 LLM 增强方法\n2. **TaL corpus (Ribeiro et al., 2020)** - 24 小时，82 位说话人，UTI+音频+视频，包含部分静默语音\n3. **SSR7000** - 超声波舌头成像 (ultrasound tongue imaging)，来自 1 位说话人的 7000 条静默话语\n4. **emg2vec** - EMG 静默语音的自监督预训练 (self-supervised pretraining)\n5. **UltraSR** - 通过声学传感进行静默语音重建 (OpenReview)\n\n现在让我完成 wiki 查询并确定论文类型。"}], "model": "GLM-5.2-w4a8", "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "9786abf0-28d7-4562-9275-27fd431c8a7e", "uuid": "b5f06eef-bd12-4333-a6dd-56d0af6625d3"}
